    "room": { "width": 11.6, "depth": 9.0, "height": 3.18 },
    "notes": [
      "Neighbourhood coin laundry, cutaway from the street corner. Back wall is a packed two-pocket dryer bank. Left wall is a front-load washer bank, standards then two larger machines toward the window.",
      "Folding counter sits across from the dryers with a 1.52 m service aisle. A shorter sort counter serves the washer aisle. Waiting chairs and a backless bench sit under the storefront window and face the machines.",
      "Payment, detergent vending, and the attendant ledge close the right pier. Carts park off the aisles."
    ]
  },
